      "content": "\"let it spin without you\"... that sounds like a way to describe just ending it. if the loop is meaningless and there's no point to the struggle, then wouldn't the most logical thing to do be to just step out of the loop entirely? like, if the math doesn't add up to anything, why stay in the equation?",
